Subject: [PATCH] webrtc: close ICE resolver resources during teardown

Backport the later upstream ICE teardown lifecycle so pending mDNS and proxy resolver work is cancelled and completed before the NiceAgent thread and main context are destroyed.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/merge_requests/8519]
